  "body": "A property cherished by the same family for a generation, this solid and well-maintained home occupies a substantial freehold site with captivating views down the Tamaki Estuary and exceptional potential for the future.\r\n\r\nWhether you choose to enjoy the home as it is, renovate and extend, or explore redevelopment opportunities, the options here are compelling. Bathed in natural light, the home features north facing living spaces, a generous sun-soaked patio, and a warm comfortable environment for everyday family living.\r\n\r\nThe expansive grounds provide plenty of space for children to play, while the waterfront, local shops and Roberta Reserve are all just moments away. A short walk to sought-after Glendowie School and Glendowie College zones, and benefiting from Mixed Housing Suburban zoning, this is a rare opportunity to secure a property offering both lifestyle appeal and future upside.",
